sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor 1 as dApp user<br />[Person]
  participant 38 as @fhevm/confidential-token<br />[Container: TypeScript]
  participant 3 as Solana cluster<br />[Software System]
  participant 16 as confidential-token<br />[Container: Anchor program]
  participant 28 as @fhevm/sdk/solana<br />[Container: TypeScript]
  participant 49 as Decryption router<br />[Container: Rust]
  participant 51 as Endpoint<br />[Container: Rust]
  participant 52 as kms-worker Solana pipeline<br />[Container: Rust]
  participant 53 as KMS core<br />[Software System]
  participant 5 as zama-host<br />[Container: Anchor program]

  1->>38: Builds disable_incoming_transfers (proposed) and make_token_account_handle_public(Balance, current handle)
  38->>3: Sends both in one transaction and confirms it at finalized<br />[JSON-RPC]
  3->>16: Sets the incoming-disabled flag (confidential_transfer now refuses credits), then seals the balance handle public
  1->>28: publicDecryptCertificate(balance handle)
  28->>49: Posts the public decryption<br />[HTTPS]
  49->>51: Forwards to every connector<br />[HTTPS]
  51->>52: Queues the request
  52->>53: Checks the public leaf, then decrypts: 0
  1->>38: Builds close_token_account(certificate) (proposed)
  38->>3: Sends the transaction and confirms it at finalized<br />[JSON-RPC]
  3->>16: close_token_account: no PendingBurn, certificate handle equals the current balance
  16->>5: verify_public_decrypt by CPI: cleartext is 0
  16->>5: close_encrypted_store by CPI (proposed): emits StoreClosed { store, program, scope, leaf_count, peaks }, returns the rent
  3->>16: Closes the token account and returns its rent to the owner